  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The applicant has not provided accurate plans of the existing dwelling. As such, officers are unable to accurately determine this application and ensure that the proposed scheme would be in accordance with the relevant classes of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The plans provided show that proposed\r\nhip-to-gable end extension would extend beyond the principle roof slope of the\r\nexisting/original first-floor side projection which fronts a highway.&amp;nbsp; Therefore, the proposed scheme as shown would\r\nnot be in accordance with B.1 (c) of part 1 of schedule 2 of the Town and\r\nCountry Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as\r\namended.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
